": true}, "id": 322, "type": "RandomNoise", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.29.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RandomNoise"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [524], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["### subject_definitions\n- subject_1: \"李梅\", a 40-year-old impoverished woman, gaunt and weather-beaten face, disheveled hair, wearing tattered coarse hemp ancient-style clothing, expression filled with endurance and grief\n- subject_2: \"元元\", a 5-year-old impoverished girl, messy hair, dirt smudges on her face, wearing patched and torn clothes, eyes timid and frightened\n\n### style_and_atmosphere\nPhotorealistic cinematic style, ancient Chinese rural interior, dark stormy morning with heavy rain and thunder outside, dim natural light filtering through the room, warm earthy tones of rammed earth walls, somber and tragic atmosphere, shallow depth of field during close-ups, historical drama aesthetic, high-detail textures on wood, clay, and fabric surfaces.\n\n### summary\nA 10-second, 4:3 aspect ratio, 2K video. On a stormy morning with heavy rain and thunder, a dying mother lies on a wooden bed in a humble ancient Chinese home. Her young daughter kneels beside her, crying, as they exchange final words. No background music, only diegetic sounds.\n\n### integrated_multimodal_description\n- [Shot 1] [0.00-3.00s] [Wide shot, eye-level, interior of a humble house] [A modest ancient Chinese single-room house with rammed earth walls. Left side — storage and activity area: a rectangular wooden table with rough texture against the wall, flanked by a long wooden bench and a small square stool. Behind the table stands a two-tier wooden shelf neatly stacked with clay pots, bowls, and a round woven basket on top. Middle area — wall decoration: two recessed square niches symmetrically placed on the earth wall. Between them hangs a cylindrical woven basket and a bundle of dried grass/wheat. In front of the niches sits a small four-drawer wooden cabinet with a thin candle burning and a small clay pot on top. A dark clay pot sits on the ground beside it. Right side — sleeping area: a low wooden bed with thick legs against the wall, covered with a yellow woven mat, layered with a gray-blue quilted thick pad underneath and a neatly folded reddish-brown thin blanket on top. A clay pot sits on the floor at the foot of the bed, and a small square stool is beside the bed's right edge. Outside, heavy rain pours down, pounding against the roof, with flashes of lightning and rumbling thunder. subject_1 lies motionless on the bed. subject_2 kneels beside the bed on the cold dirt floor, weeping. The atmosphere is heavy with grief.]\n- [Shot 2] [3.00-5.50s] [Medium shot on subject_1, lying on the bed, side angle] [subject_1's face is pale and gaunt, dark circles under her eyes. She turns her head weakly toward subject_2, her voice faint and strained, barely above a whisper, filled with despair. She speaks slowly, each word requiring immense effort: \"元元，我恐怕是挺不住了.\" A tear rolls from the corner of her eye, disappearing into the pillow. In the background, rain continues to pour and thunder rumbles.]\n- [Shot 3] [5.50-8.00s] [Medium shot on subject_2, slightly low angle] [subject_2 kneels on the cold dirt floor, her small hands gripping her mother's limp hand tightly. Her face is red from crying, tears carving tracks through the dirt on her cheeks, her expression filled with grief and fear. Her messy hair clings to her wet face. She shakes her head frantically, her voice cracking with desperation, crying out: \"不会的，我现在就去找吃的！\" She lets go of her mother's hand and begins to stand up.]\n- [Shot 4] [8.00-10.00s] [Wide shot, subject_2 rising and moving toward the door] [subject_2 scrambles to her feet, her bare feet pressing against the dirt floor. She turns toward the entrance, determination mixed with tears on her face. Lightning flashes outside the wooden door, illuminating the heavy rain pouring down. She takes a step forward, ready to run out into the storm. In the background, subject_1's hand rests limp on the bed, her eyes slowly closing. Rain and thunder continue.]\n\n### overall_soundscape\nHeavy rain pouring relentlessly, pounding against the thatched roof and hitting the ground outside, with loud rumbling thunder and occasional lightning cracks. The wind howls through cracks in the walls. Crisp sound effects: subject_1's weak, raspy whispers filled with despair, subject_2's desperate crying and frantic breathing, the rustle of coarse fabric, the slap of bare feet on packed earth as she stands, the creak of the wooden floor beneath her. No background music.\n\n### non_diegetic_music\nNone."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [548.5062255859375, 791.1451416015625], "pos": [-8686.2060546875, 10329.220703125], "id": 278, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "value", "links": [469], "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": [16], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "INTConstant", "title": "步数", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 58], "pos": [-8040.57470703125, 10844.8349609375], "id": 324, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "IN